              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Minnesota_Girl"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I could not stop eating this - it was SO good! Left out the green onions due to personal taste and cut the amount of oil to make it a little healthier. I've never heard of \"shoepeg\" corn before and I found it with the other regular canned corn. I think using regular yellow corn would change the taste so find shoepeg if possible! This might be my new \"go-to\" party appetizer. LOVED it!!!! Thanks for sharing!"
          },
