              "name": "charlene35"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Delish! This is a great recipe &amp; you can make it your own by adding your favorite spices and veggie /bean combos. I omitted the oil, added diced jalapeno, red onion, chili powder, fresh minced garlic &amp; the juice of 1/2 lime. I always let my set up for 24 hours.",
